# --- ledger-state (adapot, account, governance-aggr). Pause rules hold the step for 45 s, so the runner can
# inject a fault while it is in progress; the marker line tells the runner the step has started.
RULE adapot-pause-calc
CLASS com.bloxbean.cardano.yaci.store.adapot.service.EpochRewardCalculationService
METHOD calculateEpochRewards
AT ENTRY
BIND f:java.io.File = new java.io.File(System.getProperty("rt.trig"), "adapot-pause-calc")
IF f.exists() AND f.delete()
DO traceln("[byteman] adapot-pause-calc start"); Thread.sleep(45000L); traceln("[byteman] adapot-pause-calc end")
ENDRULE

